  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "185 m Kurven, Täler und Buckel von 185 ml auf dieser Pumptrack-Piste. Skates, Fahrräder, BMX-Räder, Mountainbikes, Inline-Skates, Roller, Skateboards ...!\r\nGrüne Piste: 48 ml; blaue Piste: 95 ml; rote Piste: 20 ml"
    ],
    "en": [
      "185 m of curves, hollows and bumps on this 185 ml Pumptrack track. On your skates, bikes, BMX, mountain bikes, rollerblades, scooters, skateboards, etc.!\r\nGreen track: 48 ml; blue track: 95 ml; red track: 20 ml"
    ],
    "it": [
      "185 m di curve, avvallamenti e dossi su questa pista Pumptrack da 185 ml. Tirate fuori i pattini, le biciclette, le BMX, le mountain bike, i pattini a rotelle, gli scooter, gli skateboard, ecc!\r\nPista verde: 48 m; pista blu: 95 m; pista rossa: 20 m"
    ],
    "fr": [
      "185 m de courbes, de creux et de bosses des 185 ml sur cette piste de Pumptrack. A vos skates, vélos, BMX, VTT, rollers, trottinettes, skateboards… ! \r\nPiste verte : 48 ml ; piste bleue :  95 ml ; piste rouge : 20 ml"
    ],
    "es": [
      "185 m de curvas, huecos y baches en esta pista de Pumptrack de 185 ml. ¡Saca tus patines, bicis, BMX, mountain bikes, patines, patinetes, monopatines, etc!\r\nPista verde: 48 m; pista azul: 95 m; pista roja: 20 m"
    ],
    "nl": [
      "185 m bochten, holtes en hobbels op deze 185 ml lange Pumptrack-baan. Haal je skates, fietsen, BMX's, mountainbikes, skeelers, steps, skateboards, enz. tevoorschijn!\r\nGroene baan: 48 m; blauwe baan: 95 m; rode baan: 20 m"
    ]
  },
